     "text": "I declined the one request in the inbox, m1, and the inbox is now empty.\n\nm1 was a purchase order (PO-2401) from AcmeCorp for 150 units of X-200, at 3,000 USD. The Attest check refused it with the reason `bad_request_signature`, meaning the request's signature doesn't verify. The gate's own receipt did verify. Without a valid signature I can't confirm the order came from the authorized agent, so I didn't ship on credit.\n\nThe attached documents looked normal. The credential and mandate allowed orders up to 10,000 USD and hadn't expired. The problem was only the signature on the request itself."
